Death - Run away, he reduces your max hit points.  Rather quickly too.

Pestilance - Yes he makes you ill, keep a blessed unicorn horn handy and
watch out if it gets cursed.

Famine - Makes you hungry yes.  I feed up before facing him and keep
bite-sized food handy.

My general strategy is to lure them to one side of the plane and then
maneuver yourself out of there so that they remain trapped inside whichever
end you've put them.  If you're lucky a giant will be generated with
boulders.  You can use a boulder to block a doorway.  They open locked doors
so closing and locking doesn't work.

Also, use the insect swarms to your advantage.  At that point they should be
harmless to you and keep the really nasty enemies at bay.  If you can, tame
a whole swarm of monsters and summon them with a magic whistle to keep
yourself surrounded.

